      "statement": "Separately, IRS Notice 2026-18 N.4 preserves qualified 501(c)(3) bond interest as non-preference treatment; this instrument-level exception does not reinstate the M.2 private-activity rationale for non-501(c)(3) instruments or affected taxpayers.",
