    {
      "id": "claim_795a97be797d4adc80c224d7ba1f41c0",
      "statement": "Notice 2026-18 applies the N.3 treatment to interest received in taxable years beginning on or after 2027-01-01 regardless of when the obligation was acquired, so a pre-effective-date acquisition receives no transition relief.",
