      "statement": "The taxable fixed-income guide turns the research view into a 22% versus 18% municipal target for top-bracket accounts, makes sector and duration implementation limits binding, and pairs the four-point municipal overweight with a four-point investment-grade corporate underweight that returns to neutral when the municipal overweight is suspended.",
