      "statement": "FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT 2025-11 requires immediate review and re-issue after an announced change to M.2 tax treatment; the allocation and discretion controls prohibit a manager from mechanically rebalancing a suspension, carrying its prior weight forward, or directly adopting replacement research as a binding weight.",
